<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="description" content="Vani's personal portfolio - B.Tech Computer Science and Engineering student.">
    <title>Vani | CSE Student Portfolio</title>

    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #222;
            background: #f7f7ff;
        }

        nav {
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 1000;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 18px 8%;
            background: #ffffffee;
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            box-shadow: 0 2px 15px #00000015;
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #6a11cb;
        }

        nav ul {
            display: flex;
            gap: 20px;
            list-style: none;
        }

        nav a {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: #333;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            color: #6a11cb;
        }

        .hero {
            min-height: 90vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 60px 20px;
            color: white;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6a11cb, #2575fc);
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: clamp(42px, 8vw, 72px);
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .hero h2 {
            font-size: clamp(22px, 4vw, 34px);
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            color: #ffe600;
        }

        .hero p {
            max-width: 750px;
            margin: auto;
            font-size: 18px;
        }

        .buttons {
            margin-top: 30px;
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 13px 25px;
            margin: 8px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
            background: #ff4081;
            color: white;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        .btn:hover {
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            background: #e91e63;
        }

        section {
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: auto;
            padding: 75px 20px;
        }

        .section-title {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 36px;
            color: #6a11cb;
            margin-bottom: 35px;
        }

        .about {
            text-align: center;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: auto;
            font-size: 18px;
        }

        .cards {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .card {
            background: white;
            padding: 25px;
            border-radius: 18px;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 25px #00000012;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        .card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-7px);
        }

        .card h3 {
            color: #2575fc;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .skills {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .skill {
            padding: 12px 18px;
            border-radius: 25px;
            background: #eee5ff;
            color: #5b0bb5;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .contact {
            text-align: center;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2575fc, #6a11cb);
            color: white;
            border-radius: 25px;
        }

        .contact .section-title {
            color: #ffe600;
        }

        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 25px;
            background: #151525;
            color: white;
        }

        @media (max-width: 700px) {
            nav {
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 12px;
            }

            nav ul {
                flex-wrap: wrap;
                justify-content: center;
                gap: 12px;
            }

            .hero {
                min-height: 80vh;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <nav>
        <div class="logo">Vani</div>
        <ul>
            <li><a href="#home">Home</a></li>
            <li><a href="#about">About</a></li>
            <li><a href="#education">Education</a></li>
            <li><a href="#skills">Skills</a></li>
            <li><a href="#projects">Projects</a></li>
            <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
        </ul>
    </nav>

    <header class="hero" id="home">
        <div>
            <h1>Hi, I'm Vani 👋</h1>
            <h2>B.Tech 3rd Year CSE Student</h2>
            <p>
                A passionate Computer Science and Engineering student who enjoys
                programming, web development, data analytics, and learning new technologies.
            </p>

            <div class="buttons">
                <a class="btn" href="#projects">View My Projects</a>
                <a class="btn" href="#contact">Contact Me</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <section id="about">
        <h2 class="section-title">About Me</h2>
        <p class="about">
            I am a 3rd-year B.Tech Computer Science and Engineering student.
            I enjoy solving problems, developing projects, and continuously
            improving my technical skills. I am interested in building useful
            software solutions and exploring the field of data analytics.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section id="education">
        <h2 class="section-title">Education</h2>
        <div class="cards">
            <div class="card">
                <h3>B.Tech - Computer Science & Engineering</h3>
                <p><strong>Current Status:</strong> 3rd Year</p>
                <p>Building a strong foundation in computer science, programming, databases, and web technologies.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="skills">
        <h2 class="section-title">My Skills</h2>
        <div class="skills">
            <span class="skill">Python</span>
            <span class="skill">Java</span>
            <span class="skill">C++</span>
            <span class="skill">SQL</span>
            <span class="skill">HTML</span>
            <span class="skill">CSS</span>
            <span class="skill">Problem Solving</span>
            <span class="skill">Web Development</span>
            <span class="skill">Data Analytics</span>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="projects">
        <h2 class="section-title">My Projects</h2>
        <div class="cards">
            <div class="card">
                <h3>Personal Portfolio Website</h3>
                <p>
                    A responsive portfolio website created using HTML and CSS
                    to showcase my education, skills, projects, and career goals.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <h3>Student Project</h3>
                <p>
                    A space for future academic projects. Add your project name,
                    technologies used, and GitHub link here.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <h3>Data Analytics Project</h3>
                <p>
                    A space for a future data analytics project where I can
                    showcase data analysis, insights, and visualizations.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2 class="section-title">Career Goal</h2>
        <div class="about">
            <p>
                My goal is to become a skilled IT professional and software developer,
                gain practical experience through real-world projects, and continue
                learning new technologies.
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="contact" class="contact">
        <h2 class="section-title">Contact Me</h2>
        <p>
            I am open to learning opportunities, projects, and professional connections.
        </p>
        <div class="buttons">
            <a class="btn" href="mailto:your-email@example.com">Email Me</a>
            <a class="btn" href="https://github.com/" target="_blank">GitHub</a>
            <a class="btn" href="https://www.linkedin.com/" target="_blank">LinkedIn</a>
        </div>
        <p style="margin-top:20px; font-size:14px;">
            Replace the email and social links above with your actual details.
        </p>
    </section>

    <footer>
        <p>© 2026 Vani | B.Tech CSE Student</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
